530..608 Comment "/// A handle moved into a closer, which closes it: the send spends the mover\'s"
609..685 Comment "/// end, so the mover has nothing left to close. The handle\'s two closes sit"
686..759 Comment "/// side by side, and the closer receives it only after the mover\'s send."
